      "source": [
        "# Hash-based pyc\n",
        "\n",
        "A hash-based pyc is a cached bytecode file validated using a hash of the source rather than its timestamp and size. It can be checked or unchecked at runtime.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-hash-based-pyc)"
      ]
    }
